#: includes/campaign_help.php:161
msgid ""
"With that plugin inactive, WPeMatico still writes its meta fields, but no "
"featured image is shown."
msgstr ""
"Con ese plugin inactivo, WPeMatico igual guarda sus campos meta, pero no se "
"muestra ninguna imagen destacada."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:165
msgid ""
"Pick the image by its position in the content -- the first, the second, the "
"third -- instead of always taking the first."
msgstr ""
"Elige la imagen por su posición en el contenido —la primera, la segunda, la "
"tercera— en lugar de tomar siempre la primera."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:170
msgid ""
"The image used as featured is stripped from the post content, so your theme "
"does not show it twice."
msgstr ""
"La imagen usada como destacada se quita del contenido de la entrada, para "
"que tu tema no la muestre dos veces."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:173 includes/settings/help.php:74
#: includes/settings/page.php:264
msgid "Allow more file types"
msgstr "Permitir más tipos de archivo"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:174 includes/settings/help.php:75
msgid ""
"Uploads files whose type the Media library does not accept by default. It "
"does not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Sube archivos cuyo tipo la biblioteca de medios no acepta por defecto. No "
"funciona en todos los servidores."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:178 includes/settings/help.php:79
msgid ""
"Keeps the caption, alt text and title that came with the image in the Media "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Conserva en la biblioteca de medios la leyenda, el texto alternativo y el "
"título que traía la imagen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:181 includes/settings/help.php:69
msgid "Use custom upload for images"
msgstr "Usar la subida propia para imágenes"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:182 includes/settings/help.php:70
msgid ""
"Saves the image exactly as it comes from the source, skipping WordPress. "
"Faster, but it does not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Guarda la imagen tal como viene del origen, sin pasar por WordPress. Es más "
"rápido, pero no funciona en todos los servidores."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:185
msgid "Audio options for this campaign"
msgstr "Opciones de audios de esta campaña"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:19
msgid "Feed addresses"
msgstr "Direcciones de los feeds"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:191
msgid ""
"Every audio in an %s tag is saved to your Uploads folder and the content "
"points at your copy. Off, the files stay on the source server."
msgstr ""
"Cada audio que esté en una etiqueta %s se guarda en tu carpeta de subidas y "
"el contenido apunta a tu copia. Apagado, los archivos siguen en el servidor "
"de origen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:195
msgid ""
"Each downloaded audio is added to the Media library and attached to its "
"post. Turn it off if the run is too slow."
msgstr ""
"Cada audio descargado se añade a la biblioteca de medios y se adjunta a su "
"entrada. Desactívalo si la ejecución es muy lenta."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:20
msgid ""
"At least one address is needed. Type a domain name and WPeMatico looks for "
"its feed. The fewer feeds a campaign has, the less each run costs."
msgstr ""
"Hace falta al menos una dirección. Escribe un dominio y WPeMatico busca su "
"feed. Cuantos menos feeds tenga una campaña, menos cuesta cada ejecución."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:200
msgid ""
"When an audio cannot be downloaded, its %s tag is removed instead of "
"pointing at the source site."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un audio no se puede descargar, se quita su etiqueta %s en lugar de "
"apuntar al sitio de origen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:203 includes/settings/help.php:107
msgid "Use custom upload for audios"
msgstr "Usar la subida propia para audios"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:204 includes/settings/help.php:108
msgid ""
"Saves the audio exactly as it comes from the source, skipping WordPress. "
"Faster, but it does not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Guarda el audio tal como viene del origen, sin pasar por WordPress. Es más "
"rápido, pero no funciona en todos los servidores."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:207
msgid "Video options for this campaign"
msgstr "Opciones de vídeos de esta campaña"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:213
msgid ""
"Every video in a %s tag is saved to your Uploads folder and the content "
"points at your copy. Video files are heavy: they fill your disk fast."
msgstr ""
"Cada vídeo que esté en una etiqueta %s se guarda en tu carpeta de subidas y "
"el contenido apunta a tu copia. Los vídeos pesan: llenan tu disco rápido."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:217
msgid ""
"Each downloaded video is added to the Media library and attached to its "
"post. Turn it off if the run is too slow."
msgstr ""
"Cada vídeo descargado se añade a la biblioteca de medios y se adjunta a su "
"entrada. Desactívalo si la ejecución es muy lenta."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:222
msgid ""
"When a video cannot be downloaded, its %s tag is removed instead of pointing "
"at the source site."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un vídeo no se puede descargar, se quita su etiqueta %s en lugar de "
"apuntar al sitio de origen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:225 includes/settings/help.php:136
msgid "Use custom upload for videos"
msgstr "Usar la subida propia para vídeos"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:226 includes/settings/help.php:137
msgid ""
"Saves the video exactly as it comes from the source, skipping WordPress. "
"Faster, but it does not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Guarda el vídeo tal como viene del origen, sin pasar por WordPress. Es más "
"rápido, pero no funciona en todos los servidores."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:232
msgid "Duplicate options for this campaign"
msgstr "Opciones de duplicados de esta campaña"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:238 includes/settings/help.php:202
msgid ""
"Turns off both duplicate checks, so every item is published again on every "
"run. Almost never what you want."
msgstr ""
"Apaga los dos controles de duplicados, así que cada ítem se vuelve a "
"publicar en cada ejecución. Casi nunca es lo que quieres."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:239 includes/settings/help.php:203
msgid "The two checks"
msgstr "Los dos controles"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:239 includes/settings/help.php:203
msgid ""
"the post title, and a hash of the last item address the campaign read. The "
"hash is the reliable one; titles alone fail often."
msgstr ""
"el título de la entrada y un hash de la dirección del último ítem que leyó "
"la campaña. El hash es el fiable; el título solo falla a menudo."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:24
msgid ""
"How many items to take from each feed above. Between 3 and 5, running more "
"often, loses fewer items than a big number run rarely. Use 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Cuántos ítems tomar de cada feed de arriba. Entre 3 y 5, ejecutando más "
"seguido, pierde menos ítems que un número grande ejecutado de vez en cuando. "
"Usa 0 para no poner límite."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:240
msgid ""
"With both off, the same items come in for ever. To publish items that share "
"a title, use \"Allow duplicate titles\" and leave the hash check on."
msgstr ""
"Con los dos apagados, los mismos ítems entran una y otra vez. Para publicar "
"ítems que comparten título, usa «Permitir títulos duplicados» y deja el "
"control por hash activo."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:244 includes/settings/help.php:208
msgid ""
"The campaign skips each duplicate and keeps looking for new items, instead "
"of stopping at the first one. Not recommended."
msgstr ""
"La campaña salta cada duplicado y sigue buscando ítems nuevos, en lugar de "
"parar en el primero. No recomendado."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:245 includes/settings/help.php:209
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Cómo funciona"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:245 includes/settings/help.php:209
msgid ""
"feed items come ordered newest first, so the campaign reads from the top and "
"stops at the first item it already has: everything below it is older and "
"already published."
msgstr ""
"los ítems del feed llegan ordenados del más nuevo al más viejo, así que la "
"campaña lee desde arriba y para en el primer ítem que ya tiene: todo lo que "
"sigue es más viejo y ya está publicado."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:246 includes/settings/help.php:210
msgid ""
"The hash only covers the last item read, so on a feed where the title check "
"works poorly this option can publish the same item twice."
msgstr ""
"El hash solo cubre el último ítem leído, así que en un feed donde el control "
"por título funciona mal esta opción puede publicar el mismo ítem dos veces."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:250 includes/settings/help.php:219
msgid ""
"One more query per item. Turn it on only if you still get duplicates, which "
"happens with feeds that do not follow the standard."
msgstr ""
"Una consulta más por ítem. Actívalo solo si sigues teniendo duplicados, algo "
"que pasa con feeds que no respetan el estándar."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:257
msgid "XML campaign type"
msgstr "Tipo de campaña XML"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:258
msgid "Reads the items of an XML file as if the file were an RSS feed."
msgstr "Lee los ítems de un archivo XML como si el archivo fuera un feed RSS."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:262 includes/xml-importer.php:459
msgid "Elements of the XML"
msgstr "Elementos del XML"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:263
msgid ""
"Choose the XML node that holds each property of an item: title, content, "
"image, date. When a node name appears more than once, name its parent in the "
"right column."
msgstr ""
"Elige el nodo XML que contiene cada propiedad del ítem: título, contenido, "
"imagen, fecha. Cuando un nombre de nodo aparece más de una vez, indica su "
"padre en la columna de la derecha."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:266 includes/xml-importer.php:460
msgid "Parent element"
msgstr "Elemento padre"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:267
msgid ""
"Tells WPeMatico which of the repeated nodes to read. It has to be the parent "
"of the node picked on the left."
msgstr ""
"Le dice a WPeMatico cuál de los nodos repetidos leer. Tiene que ser el padre "
"del nodo elegido a la izquierda."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:273
msgid "Enable the post template"
msgstr "Activar la plantilla de entradas"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:274
msgid ""
"Build the content of each post around the text the feed brings: add your own "
"text, images or campaign data before it is saved."
msgstr ""
"Arma el contenido de cada entrada alrededor del texto que trae el feed: "
"añade tu propio texto, imágenes o datos de la campaña antes de guardarlo."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:279
msgid "The feed item content."
msgstr "El contenido del ítem del feed."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:28
msgid ""
"Only for feeds that do not come newest first. On those, the campaign would "
"otherwise stop early and lose items."
msgstr ""
"Solo para feeds que no llegan del más nuevo al más viejo. En esos, la "
"campaña pararía antes de tiempo y perdería ítems."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:311 includes/settings/help.php:147
#: includes/module/actions.php:204
msgid "Words to Categories"
msgstr "Palabras a categorías"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:312 includes/settings/help.php:148
msgid ""
"Assigns a category to the post when a given word appears in the content."
msgstr ""
"Asigna una categoría a la entrada cuando una palabra determinada aparece en "
"el contenido."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:313
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Ejemplo:"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:314
msgid ""
"To file every post that mentions \"motor\" under the category \"Engines\", "
"type motor in the Word field and pick Engines in the categories list."
msgstr ""
"Para archivar en la categoría «Motores» cada entrada que menciona «motor», "
"escribe motor en el campo Palabra y elige Motores en la lista de categorías."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:315
msgid "Regular Expressions"
msgstr "Expresiones regulares"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:316
msgid ""
"Regular expressions are supported, which saves you one box per word: instead "
"of a box for motor and another for car, both pointing at Engines, use the | "
"operator -- (motor|car). Write the expression without delimiters or flags; "
"it runs over the whole field. To match regardless of case, leave the 'Case "
"sensitive' box below unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Se admiten expresiones regulares, lo que te ahorra una caja por palabra: en "
"lugar de una caja para motor y otra para coche, las dos apuntando a Motores, "
"usa el operador | —(motor|coche)—. Escribe la expresión sin delimitadores ni "
"modificadores; se aplica sobre todo el campo. Para que no distinga "
"mayúsculas, deja sin marcar la casilla «Distinguir mayúsculas» de abajo."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:32
msgid ""
"Each post keeps the date it has in the feed, instead of the moment WPeMatico "
"published it."
msgstr ""
"Cada entrada conserva la fecha que tiene en el feed, en lugar del momento en "
"que WPeMatico la publicó."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:321 includes/settings/help.php:151
msgid "Rewrite"
msgstr "Reescritura"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:322
msgid ""
"Replaces words or phrases in the content with your own text, and can turn a "
"word into a link. Click [?] below for examples."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza palabras o frases del contenido por tu propio texto, y puede "
"convertir una palabra en enlace. Haz clic en [?] abajo para ver ejemplos."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:323
msgid "Basic rewriting:"
msgstr "Re-escritura básica:"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:324
msgid ""
"To replace every \"ass\" with \"butt\", type ass in the origin field and "
"butt in \"rewrite to\"."
msgstr ""
"Para reemplazar cada «ass» por «butt», escribe ass en el campo de origen y "
"butt en «reescribir a»."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:325
msgid "Title:"
msgstr "Título:"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:326
msgid ""
"With \"Title\" checked the replacement runs on the title only, and unchecked "
"on the content only. Add the same rewrite twice to cover both."
msgstr ""
"Con «Título» marcado el reemplazo se hace solo en el título, y sin marcar "
"solo en el contenido. Añade la misma reescritura dos veces para cubrir ambos."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:327
msgid "Relinking:"
msgstr "Re-enlazar:"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:328
msgid ""
"To turn every mention of google into a link to Google, type google in the "
"origin field and %s in the 'relink to' field."
msgstr ""
"Para convertir cada mención de google en un enlace a Google, escribe google "
"en el campo de origen y %s en el campo «enlazar a»."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:329
msgid "Regular expressions"
msgstr "Expresiones regulares"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:33
msgid ""
"Badly built feeds carry impossible dates, so the feed date is used only when:"
msgstr ""
"Hay feeds mal construidos que traen fechas imposibles, así que la fecha del "
"feed se usa solo cuando:"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:330
msgid ""
"Regular expressions are supported, which saves you one box per word: to "
"replace both ass and arse with butt, use the | operator -- (ass|arse)."
msgstr ""
"Se admiten expresiones regulares, lo que te ahorra una caja por palabra: "
"para reemplazar ass y arse por butt, usa el operador | —(ass|arse)—."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:335
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Categorías"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:336
msgid ""
"Assign categories of your own to every post, take the ones the source item "
"carries, or both."
msgstr ""
"Asigna a cada entrada categorías tuyas, las que trae el ítem de origen, o "
"ambas."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:340
msgid ""
"The categories the source item carries are added to the post, and created on "
"your site if they do not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"Las categorías que trae el ítem de origen se añaden a la entrada, y se crean "
"en tu sitio si todavía no existen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:343
msgid "Limit of categories"
msgstr "Límite de categorías"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:344
msgid "How many new categories a single run may create."
msgstr "Cuántas categorías nuevas puede crear una sola ejecución."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:348
msgid ""
"Every category created by this campaign hangs from the one you pick here, "
"instead of sitting at the top level."
msgstr ""
"Cada categoría que cree esta campaña cuelga de la que elijas aquí, en lugar "
"de quedar en el primer nivel."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:35
msgid "it is not further in the past than the campaign frequency, and"
msgstr "no está más atrás en el pasado que la frecuencia de la campaña, y"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:351
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Etiquetas"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:352
msgid "Tags added to every post of this campaign."
msgstr "Etiquetas que se añaden a cada entrada de esta campaña."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:355 includes/campaigns_list.php:1226
#: includes/campaigns_list.php:1415
msgid "Post format"
msgstr "Formato de entrada"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:356
msgid ""
"The post format for this campaign, if your theme supports formats. Leave it "
"on Standard if it does not."
msgstr ""
"El formato de entrada de esta campaña, si tu tema admite formatos. Déjalo en "
"Estándar si no lo hace."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:36
msgid "it is not in the future."
msgstr "no está en el futuro."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:361
msgid "Log by email"
msgstr "Registro por correo"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:362
msgid ""
"Sends you what happened on each run. You can ask for it only when something "
"went wrong, or leave the field empty for no email at all."
msgstr ""
"Te envía lo que pasó en cada ejecución. Puedes pedirlo solo cuando algo "
"salió mal, o dejar el campo vacío para no recibir ningún correo."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:40
msgid ""
"Takes the feed date whatever it says, including old items arriving after "
"newer ones."
msgstr ""
"Toma la fecha del feed diga lo que diga, incluidos ítems viejos que llegan "
"después de otros más nuevos."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:44
msgid ""
"The title of each post points at the original article instead of at your own "
"post."
msgstr ""
"El título de cada entrada apunta al artículo original en lugar de a tu "
"propia entrada."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:45
msgid ""
"It needs the plugin custom fields, so it does nothing while those are turned "
"off in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Necesita los campos personalizados del plugin, así que no hace nada mientras "
"estén desactivados en los Ajustes."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:49
msgid "Your post keeps the exact permalink the source article has."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrada conserva el enlace permanente exacto que tiene el artículo de "
"origen."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:53
msgid ""
"The address in the feed is taken as it comes, without following its "
"redirects to the final article."
msgstr ""
"La dirección que viene en el feed se toma tal cual, sin seguir sus "
"redirecciones hasta el artículo final."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:54
msgid ""
"Leave it on for speed. Turn it off when the permalinks you get are not the "
"original ones."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo activo por velocidad. Desactívalo cuando los enlaces que obtienes no "
"son los originales."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:58
msgid "Allows pingbacks and trackbacks on the posts this campaign publishes."
msgstr ""
"Permite pingbacks y trackbacks en las entradas que publica esta campaña."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:62
msgid ""
"Title and content are converted to UTF-8 when the feed sends them in another "
"encoding. Fixes feeds that arrive full of strange characters."
msgstr ""
"El título y el contenido se convierten a UTF-8 cuando el feed los envía en "
"otra codificación. Arregla los feeds que llegan llenos de caracteres raros."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:65
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Comentarios"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:66
msgid "Whether the posts of this campaign accept comments."
msgstr "Si las entradas de esta campaña aceptan comentarios."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:69 includes/campaigns_list.php:1160
#: includes/campaigns_list.php:1356
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Autor"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:70
msgid "The author every post of this campaign is published under."
msgstr "El autor con el que se publica cada entrada de esta campaña."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:71
msgid ""
"The author and the post status are saved as your own user is entitled to set "
"them, because the campaign runs later on its schedule, when nobody is logged "
"in. A user who cannot publish posts saves the campaign with the status "
"Pending review, and a user who cannot assign posts to other users saves it "
"under their own name. The campaign screen reports it right after saving, so "
"the value you see is always the one that will be used. Administrators and "
"editors are not affected."
msgstr ""
"El autor y el estado de la entrada se guardan según lo que tu usuario tenga "
"permitido, porque la campaña se ejecuta más tarde, según su programación, "
"cuando no hay nadie conectado. Un usuario que no puede publicar guarda la "
"campaña con el estado «Pendiente de revisión», y uno que no puede asignar "
"entradas a otros la guarda a su propio nombre. La pantalla de la campaña lo "
"avisa justo después de guardar, así que el valor que ves es siempre el que "
"se usará. A administradores y editores no les afecta."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:75
msgid ""
"The description field of the item is saved as the post excerpt. Otherwise "
"WordPress builds the excerpt from the content."
msgstr ""
"El campo descripción del ítem se guarda como extracto de la entrada. Si no, "
"WordPress arma el extracto a partir del contenido."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:76
msgid ""
"Feeds with no description of their own send the content in that field, so "
"you may end up with the same text twice."
msgstr ""
"Los feeds que no traen descripción propia envían el contenido en ese campo, "
"así que puedes terminar con el mismo texto dos veces."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:81
msgid ""
"The content is saved as plain text. Images %1$s and links %2$s go with it."
msgstr ""
"El contenido se guarda como texto plano. Las imágenes %1$s y los enlaces "
"%2$s se van con él."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:85
msgid "Links stop being clickable; their text stays in place."
msgstr "Los enlaces dejan de ser clicables; su texto se queda en su lugar."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:89
msgid ""
"The feed content is saved exactly as it arrives, past the WordPress filters "
"and with its scripts. Use it only with sources you trust."
msgstr ""
"El contenido del feed se guarda exactamente como llega, sin pasar por los "
"filtros de WordPress y con sus scripts. Úsalo solo con fuentes en las que "
"confíes."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:94
msgid "YouTube feed addresses"
msgstr "Direcciones de feeds de YouTube"

#: includes/campaign_help.php:95
msgid ""
"Type the feed address of a channel, a user or a playlist. The campaign takes "
"the title, the image, the embedded video and the description."
msgstr ""
"Escribe la dirección del feed de un canal, un usuario o una lista de "
"reproducción. La campaña toma el título, la imagen, el vídeo incrustado y la "
"descripción."

#: includes/campaign_help.php:96
msgid "For a YouTube channel: "
msgstr "Para un canal de YouTube: "

#: includes/campaign_help.php:97
msgid "For a YouTube user: "
msgstr "Para un usuario de YouTube: "

#: includes/campaign_help.php:98
msgid "For a YouTube playlist: "
msgstr "Para una lista de reproducción de YouTube: "

#: includes/campaign_log.php:119
msgid "Last Log of Campaign %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "Último registro de la campaña %1$s: %2$s"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:199
msgid "Duplicate skipped, carrying on."
msgstr "Duplicado omitido, seguimos."

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:202
msgid "Filtering out duplicates."
msgstr "Filtrando los duplicados."

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:251 includes/campaign_preview_item.php:178
#: includes/campaign_preview_item.php:295
msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to preview this campaign."
msgstr "No tienes permisos suficientes para previsualizar esta campaña."

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:362 includes/campaign_preview_item.php:353
msgid "WPeMatico Preview Feed"
msgstr "Feed de vista previa de WPeMatico"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:389
msgid "Next Posts(%s)"
msgstr "Próximas entradas(%s)"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:400
msgid "Post"
msgstr "Entrada"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:402 includes/tools_page.php:530
#: includes/tools_page.php:668
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Acciones"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:447
msgid "Next fetch"
msgstr "Siguiente búsqueda"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:450 includes/campaign_preview_item.php:378
msgid "Fetch Now"
msgstr "Traer ahora"

#: includes/campaign_preview.php:46 includes/campaign_preview_item.php:276
msgid "This action comes with the Manual Fetching add-on."
msgstr "Esta acción viene con la extensión Manual Fetching."

#: includes/campaign_preview_item.php:187
