#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:63
msgid ""
"Import feed sources from WP RSS Aggregator. Feeds that create posts become "
"campaigns; display-only feeds become RSS Feed Reader campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Importa las fuentes de WP RSS Aggregator. Los feeds que crean entradas pasan "
"a ser campañas; los que solo muestran ítems pasan a ser campañas de RSS Feed "
"Reader."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:648
msgid "(no title)"
msgstr "(sin título)"

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:675
msgid "Shows all feeds — pick a campaign shortcode manually."
msgstr "Muestra todos los feeds: elige a mano el shortcode de una campaña."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:676
msgid "Combines several feeds — replace it manually."
msgstr "Combina varios feeds: sustitúyelo a mano."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:682
msgid "No migrated campaign matches this source yet — import it first."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no hay ninguna campaña migrada que corresponda a este origen: "
"impórtalo primero."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:684
msgid "This feed now creates posts, so it has no display shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Este feed ahora crea entradas, así que no tiene shortcode de visualización."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:76
msgid ""
"Import the Feedzy import jobs as campaigns. A job whose source is a feed "
"group brings every feed of that group into its campaign."
msgstr ""
"Importa las tareas de importación de Feedzy como campañas. Una tarea cuyo "
"origen sea un grupo de feeds lleva todos los feeds del grupo a su campaña."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:901
msgid ""
"Nothing to import yet: these feeds only display items. Install the RSS Feed "
"Reader addon above to import them."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no hay nada que importar: estos feeds solo muestran ítems. Instala "
"arriba la extensión RSS Feed Reader para importarlos."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:910
msgid "There is nothing to import from this plugin."
msgstr "No hay nada que importar de este plugin."

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:945
msgid "Imported from %s"
msgstr "Importado de %s"

#: includes/migration/class-migration-manager.php:948
msgid "(original #%s)"
msgstr "(original n.º %s)"

#: includes/migration/detect.php:228
msgid "Import them now"
msgstr "Importarlos ahora"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of source plugin names.
#: includes/migration/detect.php:231
msgid ""
"WPeMatico found feeds from %s on this site. Import them as campaigns and you "
"can drop the other plugin."
msgid_plural ""
"WPeMatico found feeds from these plugins on this site: %s. Import them as "
"campaigns and you can drop the other plugins."
msgstr[0] ""
"WPeMatico encontró feeds de %s en este sitio. Impórtalos como campañas y "
"podrás prescindir del otro plugin."
msgstr[1] ""
"WPeMatico encontró feeds de estos plugins en este sitio: %s. Impórtalos como "
"campañas y podrás prescindir de los otros plugins."

#: includes/migration/detect.php:241
msgid "Enable Plugin Importers"
msgstr "Activar los importadores de plugins"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of source plugin names.
#: includes/migration/detect.php:244
msgid ""
"WPeMatico found feeds from %s on this site. Enable the Plugin Importers "
"module to bring them over as campaigns."
msgid_plural ""
"WPeMatico found feeds from these plugins on this site: %s. Enable the Plugin "
"Importers module to bring them over as campaigns."
msgstr[0] ""
"WPeMatico encontró feeds de %s en este sitio. Activa el módulo «Importadores "
"de plugins» para traerlos como campañas."
msgstr[1] ""
"WPeMatico encontró feeds de estos plugins en este sitio: %s. Activa el "
"módulo «Importadores de plugins» para traerlos como campañas."

#: includes/migration/detect.php:260
msgid "WPeMatico Migration Toolkit"
msgstr "Kit de migración de WPeMatico"

#: includes/migration/help.php:31
msgid "Migration Toolkit."
msgstr "Kit de migración."

#: includes/migration/help.php:32
msgid ""
"Recreates the feeds of another RSS importing plugin as WPeMatico campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Recrea como campañas de WPeMatico los feeds de otro plugin importador de RSS."

#: includes/migration/help.php:33
msgid ""
"Each detected plugin gets its own tab; nothing is changed in the source "
"plugin, so you can import, compare the result, and only then retire it."
msgstr ""
"Cada plugin detectado tiene su propia pestaña; no se cambia nada en el "
"plugin de origen, así que puedes importar, comparar el resultado y solo "
"entonces retirarlo."

#: includes/migration/help.php:34
msgid ""
"Importing twice is safe: a source already migrated updates its campaign "
"instead of creating a second one."
msgstr ""
"Importar dos veces es seguro: un origen ya migrado actualiza su campaña en "
"vez de crear una segunda."

#: includes/migration/help.php:37
msgid "Import campaigns &amp; feeds."
msgstr "Importar campañas y feeds."

#: includes/migration/help.php:38
msgid ""
"Always done: every feed of the source plugin becomes a WPeMatico campaign, "
"with its feed URLs, limits, post type, categories, author and schedule "
"mapped to the equivalent WPeMatico settings."
msgstr ""
"Se hace siempre: cada feed del plugin de origen pasa a ser una campaña de "
"WPeMatico, con sus URLs, límites, tipo de contenido, categorías, autor y "
"programación equivalentes."

#: includes/migration/help.php:39
msgid ""
"Imported campaigns arrive deactivated, so nothing is fetched until you "
"review them and start them yourself."
msgstr ""
"Las campañas importadas llegan desactivadas, así que no se lee nada hasta "
"que las revises y las pongas en marcha tú."

#: includes/migration/help.php:42
msgid "Keep the feeds of a group together in one campaign."
msgstr "Mantener juntos en una campaña los feeds de un grupo."

#: includes/migration/help.php:43
msgid ""
"A feed group is only a named list of feeds. What becomes a campaign is the "
"import job that uses it (in Feedzy, a row of its Import Posts screen)."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de feeds es solo una lista con nombre. Lo que pasa a ser campaña es "
"la tarea de importación que lo usa (en Feedzy, una fila de su pantalla "
"«Import Posts»)."

#: includes/migration/help.php:44
msgid ""
"So a group is imported when a job has it as its source, and the campaign of "
"that job gets every feed of the group. A group no job uses has nothing to "
"import."
msgstr ""
"Así que un grupo se importa cuando una tarea lo tiene como origen, y la "
"campaña de esa tarea recibe todos los feeds del grupo. Un grupo que ninguna "
"tarea usa no tiene nada que importar."

#: includes/migration/help.php:45
msgid ""
"Checked (the default), those feeds stay together in that single campaign, "
"exactly as the source plugin had them."
msgstr ""
"Marcado (lo predeterminado), esos feeds siguen juntos en esa única campaña, "
"igual que los tenía el plugin de origen."

#: includes/migration/help.php:46
msgid ""
"Unchecked, each feed of the group becomes its own campaign, which is handy "
"when you want different settings or schedules per feed."
msgstr ""
"Sin marcar, cada feed del grupo pasa a ser su propia campaña, útil si "
"quieres ajustes o programaciones distintas para cada uno."

#: includes/migration/help.php:49
msgid "Optional feature imports."
msgstr "Importaciones opcionales."

#: includes/migration/help.php:50
msgid ""
"Advanced settings of the source (keyword filters, fallback image, automatic "
"translation, content rewriting) are recreated on the WPeMatico addon that "
"provides the same feature."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes avanzados del origen (filtros por palabras clave, imagen de "
"reserva, traducción automática, reescritura de contenido) se recrean en la "
"extensión de WPeMatico que ofrece esa misma función."

#: includes/migration/help.php:51
msgid ""
"A checkbox only appears when the source really has that data. If the addon "
"it needs is not active the checkbox is shown disabled, naming the addon."
msgstr ""
"Una casilla solo aparece si el origen tiene de verdad esos datos. Si la "
"extensión que necesita no está activa, la casilla se muestra desactivada "
"indicando cuál es."

#: includes/migration/help.php:52
msgid ""
"You can import now without that addon — no source data is lost. Install it "
"later and run the import again to fill in the missing fields."
msgstr ""
"Puedes importar ahora sin esa extensión: no se pierde ningún dato del "
"origen. Instálala más tarde y vuelve a importar para rellenar los campos que "
"falten."

#: includes/migration/help.php:55
msgid "Adopt the posts already published by this plugin."
msgstr "Adoptar las entradas que ya publicó este plugin."

#: includes/migration/help.php:56
msgid ""
"The source plugin has probably been publishing for a while. This links those "
"posts to their new campaign so WPeMatico knows the items were already "
"imported and does not publish them a second time."
msgstr ""
"Lo más probable es que el plugin de origen lleve tiempo publicando. Esto "
"vincula esas entradas a su nueva campaña para que WPeMatico sepa que esos "
"ítems ya se importaron y no los publique otra vez."

#: includes/migration/help.php:57
msgid ""
"The posts themselves are not modified, moved or duplicated: only the origin "
"information WPeMatico writes on any fetched post is added to them."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas no se modifican, ni se mueven, ni se duplican: solo se les "
"añade la información de origen que WPeMatico escribe en cualquier entrada "
"que trae."

#: includes/migration/help.php:58
msgid ""
"The number shown is how many posts are still waiting to be linked, so the "
"option disappears once they all are."
msgstr ""
"El número que se muestra es cuántas entradas quedan por vincular, así que la "
"opción desaparece cuando ya están todas."

#: includes/migration/help.php:61
msgid "Activate reader campaigns and fetch their content now."
msgstr "Activar las campañas de lectura y traer su contenido ahora."

#: includes/migration/help.php:62
msgid ""
"Feeds that only display items (they never created posts) become RSS Feed "
"Reader campaigns, which show the items they have already fetched."
msgstr ""
