msgid "Deactivate the source plugin after import."
msgstr "Desactivar el plugin de origen al terminar."

#: includes/migration/help.php:67
msgid ""
"Once the migration succeeds the original plugin is deactivated, together "
"with its own add-ons, so both plugins do not import the same feeds in "
"parallel."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la migración termina bien, el plugin original se desactiva junto con "
"sus propias extensiones, para que los dos plugins no importen los mismos "
"feeds a la vez."

